WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.069 --> 00:00:07.630
Element 110 is darmstadtium and darmstadtium
is named

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:12.419
after the German town of Darmstadt which is
where the big

00:00:12.419 --> 00:00:17.039
German accelerator, the so-called Gesellschaft
fur

00:00:17.039 --> 00:00:22.279
Schwerionenforschung, the Society for Heavy
Iron Research is

00:00:22.279 --> 00:00:27.490
situated and this is because darmstadtium
does not occur

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:33.809
naturally and has to be made. So as element
110 you have to

00:00:33.809 --> 00:00:37.110
have the nucleus of the atom actually having
the right

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:42.450
number of protons to be 110. So it is 110
protons, so the

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:46.719
way that they do it is that they take a lump
of lead, I have no

00:00:46.719 --> 00:00:52.250
idea how big and fire at it at enormous speed,
ions from

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:57.789
nickel. Lead is element number 82, nickel
is element number

00:00:57.789 --> 00:01:05.320
28. 28 plus 82 adds up to 110. So the idea
is that these

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:09.500
nickel atoms bang away all the time, at the
lead and most of

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:15.060
the time, everything flies to pieces but one
collision every

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:19.750
hundred or thousand million, the two nuclei
can fuse together

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:26.119
and for a short time form the element. And
so element 110

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:29.930
was formed in this way and only a few atoms
have ever been

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:31.630
observed.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:37.869
The nucleus of the atom is electrically charged
and so they

00:01:37.869 --> 00:01:43.060
have an accelerator which contains negatively-charged
plates

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:46.189
which accelerates these things up close to
the speed of light,

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:50.460
so there are enormously energetic. It is like
propelling a

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:54.530
cricket ball at fantastic speeds so they have
a huge amount of

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:58.270
energy because if you imagine it the two nuclei
are both

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:01.590
positively-charged; you need an awful lot
of energy to get

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:05.170
these two to go together. It is like banging
together two

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:09.020
magnets which have the same polarity, you
can’t really push

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:12.270
them together easily they tend to repel, but
if you push them

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:13.920
hard enough - boom!

